 
 const metaphorData = [
                    { "name": "Ajay More", "metaphor": "A Compass", "text": "For me a Coach resembles a Compass, which says 'you are free to choose the course of your life'. It assists you selflessly to sketch a detailed map with precision...", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed:`AFTER years of waiting, finally I took the first step into the
        Coaching world. Initially it sounded easy-going, but then
        it compelled me to rethink about this path that I had
        chosen, and worrying if I can really conquer my fears, deficits and
        experience the shift towards the person I always wanted to be.
        But each session I went through only kept unveiling my sphere
        which assured me that I am on track. Today, being more self-aware
        and enduring this transformation for the past few weeks, I strongly
        believe that each one is guided by a consciousness which helps us
        steer towards most of the things that we do in life accentuating our
        values, passions, experiences, and veracities.
        When asked to define my metaphor for coaching, I could only relate
        to a Compass, “knowing where you are and where you wish to be”.
        Since its invention in 206 BC, the sole purpose of a compass has been
        to provide its bearer with a sense of hope, guidance, direction and
        flawlessly ensuring that the seekers do not drift from their purpose
        that offers them serenity evading judgements, criticism & curiosity.
        For me a Coach resembles a Compass, which says “you are free to
        choose the course of your life”. It assists you selflessly to sketch a
        detailed map with precision, provides a sense of confidence, ensures
        focus & calibration till the coachee reaches the desired destination
        which is guided by coachees' own value structure and keeping them
        to their True North.` },
                    { "name": "Anshul Aggarwal", "metaphor": "a CAR!", "text": "A Coach is like a car as the Coachee who is the driver decides where he or she wants to go and the Coach enables the Coachee to reach there.", "batch": "Batch-50",detailed:`A Coach is like a car as the Coachee who is the driver decides where he or she
        wants to go and the Coach enables the Coachee to reach there.
        It is never the car which decides at what speed or in which direction to go.
        Similarly the Coach provides the environment where the Coachee can decide
        the pace and direction of the conversation through a clear coaching contract.
        I have had multiple conversations while driving a car and feel it is a safe space
        for me. Similarly a Coach provides a safe space for the Coachee to share and
        have a great conversation
        A car comes along with great features to help the driver navigate the complex
        routes easily. Similarly a Coach is equipped with a lot of tools to help the
        Coachee brainstorm and find solutions to the problems being faced.
        Over the years I have become very comfortable with my car. Similarly the Coach
        and Coachee relationship develops over a period of time and both benefit from
        it immensely
        Thank you Nandita and Sanjeev, my accountability partners for helping me in
        this Journey. Special thanks to Gaurav and Preeti Verma, PCC (ICF) for a great
        program` },
                    { "name": "Arun Sharma", "metaphor": "Amplified Mirror", "text": "In my limited time of understanding Coaching as a discipline, I find Coaching to be like 'Amplifying Mirror'; which should empower coachee to delve into much deeper details of self.", "batch": "Batch-50",detailed:`The role of leader is not to make the path easier for the team, rather make the team stronger
        in their resolve to take on any challenges come what may in their journey towards higher
        accomplishments.
        It’s been a while since I was contemplating to understand coaching discipline in so that I could equip
        self with skills of effective listening and empathy. There have been numerous nudges that influenced
        me to take the step and finally, I did enroll for ICF Coaching Certification, the 'Art and Science of
        Coaching', surely intrigued my attention to take the final plunge.
        Coaching Enabling Self Reflection As
        'Amplified Mirror'
        The whole process has been great ‘unlearning’
        experience for me and am feeling very pleased to
        have embarked on this journey. One of the key
        exercises of Coaching journey is to illustrate the
        whole coaching process through a metaphor.
        Please do take out time to read through the article,
        wherein I have shared brief reflection on learning
        from past 3 weeks of coaching journey; which has
        been carefully orchestrated through multiple case
        studies, tools & templates, and experiences of my
        fellow coaching enthusiasts.
        Individuals do what they want to do and most of
        the conversations / consultations involved in
        taking any decisions are merely reflections of
        inner voices of the individuals. While individuals
        do reach out for help or deliberation with their
        network of experts / leaders/ friends; the mind has
        the selective ability to filter out what’s important
        & relevant, and often, these selections are driven
        by pre-determined choices of the individuals.
        However, there could always be additional layers
        to these problems & situations that individual may
        or may not want to uncover.
        Coach enables individuals to see through
        themselves in a transparent manner – uncovering
        layer by layer, challenging assumptions & biases
        and questioning pre-conceived notions of the
        coachee.
        With my life of continuous travel, one thing I really
        cherish is ‘Amplifying Mirror’; that one gets to use
        in lavish hotel rooms. The ‘amplifying mirror’
        enlarges the objects and one can see through
        those minor aspects in a much greater detail. The
        skin texture, pigmentation, blackheads, moles etc.
        do become ever so visible and prominent. Often,
        these mirrors are illuminated as well and that adds
        the brightness too.
        In my limited time of understanding Coaching as
        a discipline, I find Coaching to be like ‘Amplifying
        Mirror’; which should empower coachee to delve
        into much deeper details of self. These details do
        cover widespread range of emotional nuances,
        biases, assumptions, limitations, and doubts. Basis
        initial practice sessions with fellow participants in
        coaching journey, I have already witnessed power
        of coaching for identifying deeper meaning /
        identify for coachees. One could observe the
        different level of verve and energy at the end of
        coaching session and individual has profusely
        thanked the coach for being the guiding light.
        There have been couple of decisions that I was
        contemplating in past few weeks and my coaching
        sessions have been of immense help in clarifying
        my assumptions to take up the decision, that I am
        most convinced about.
        There are many more aspects to explore in
        coaching journey and more importantly, new skills
        to develop (detached curiosity, attentive listening,
        art of questioning and not jumping to give solution
        etc.). I am very grateful to my fellow coaching
        journey passengers of Erikson Coaching
        Certification, led by Gaurav Arora, MCC (ICF)
        and Preeti Verma, PCC (ICF) and to my
        accountability partner Uma Rao Ganduri for her
        invaluable support during the journey.
        I am really geared up to explore how this
        ‘Amplifying Mirror' enables me to serve as better
        individual across my professional and personal
        spheres.` },
                    { "name": "Boishakhi Banerjee", "metaphor": "The Boat", "text": "a coach is someone that the coachee uses to find their way to the destination they are seeking, just like the two children were using the oars to maneuver their way exploring the path down the river.", "batch": "Batch-50",
        detailed:`AS I sat at a small coffee shop by the side of the sea talking to my coaching
        facilitator, the calm of the ocean seemed to fill me with a sense of
        serenity. The soft ripples of the waves, the gentle breeze and big ships
        floating away far off in the horizon is a picture that is plastered in my mind.
        We were discussing what coaching really means and where I want to be as a
        coach. And then in my mind, a beautiful image flashed by – a small red boat
        floating down a river which has lush green trees on its sides and two beautiful
        children, each with an oar in their hand, rowing the boat. `
                     },
                    { "name": "Jyoti Sharma", "metaphor": "A Pencil", "text": "When asked to pen down my coaching metaphor, all I could precisely relate to was a Pencil. The best self is lying beneath; that's what it is! At CORE.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `In the world of coaching, I see the pencil as a powerful tool for transformation. Just as a pencil starts as a simple wooden stick with graphite inside, waiting to be sharpened and used, a coachee begins with untapped potential. The coach acts as the sharpener, refining skills and revealing the core essence. Through sessions, the coachee writes their own story, erasing mistakes and drawing new paths. The pencil's eraser symbolizes forgiveness and growth, allowing for continuous improvement. Ultimately, the pencil creates art from blank paper, much like coaching helps individuals craft their best selves from within.` },
                    { "name": "Jahnavi Varampati", "metaphor": "A sculptor", "text": "To me, Coach is just like a sculptor who takes a raw block of stone and, with skill and precision, carves it into a magnificent work of art...", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Coaching is an art form where the coach is the sculptor, patiently chipping away at the rough edges of the coachee's potential. Each session is a careful strike with the chisel, guided by the coachee's vision. The raw stone represents hidden talents and dreams, and through dialogue and reflection, the coach helps shape them into something beautiful. It's a collaborative process, where the coachee provides the marble, and the coach facilitates the carving, ensuring the final masterpiece reflects the coachee's true essence.` },
                    { "name": "Muniraj GN", "metaphor": "The Pen", "text": "The pen serves as a remarkable metaphor for the coaching profession. It embodies the potential for change, the precision of goal-setting, the resilience to overcome setbacks...", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `A pen in the hands of a coach is a tool for inscribing dreams onto reality. It starts with ink, representing knowledge and insights, and paper, symbolizing the coachee's life canvas. The coach guides the pen, helping the coachee write goals with precision, cross out obstacles, and rewrite narratives. Just as a pen can endure pressure and keep flowing, coaching builds resilience. The final story penned is one of growth, where the coachee becomes the author of their own success.` },
                    { "name": "Nandita Kaushik", "metaphor": "An Amazing Wild Animal - Elephant", "text": "I am inspired by an amazing wild animal – an Elephant. I believe a coach is one who invites us to share knowledge, care for another, and possibly engage in and share deep connection with another.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `The elephant, with its strength and wisdom, mirrors the coach's role in guiding gently yet powerfully. Elephants travel in herds, fostering community, much like coaching builds supportive networks. The coach, like an elephant, remembers paths taken and untaken, helping coachees navigate life's savannas. Through patience and empathy, the coach nurtures deep connections, encouraging coachees to share burdens and celebrate triumphs, ultimately leading to profound personal growth.` },
                    { "name": "Nirupama Kotikalapudi", "metaphor": "Sculptor", "text": "To me a coach is like a 'Sculptor' bringing life and depth to the visions, aspirations and dreams of the coachee.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `As a sculptor shapes clay into form, a coach molds aspirations into achievements. The coachee brings the raw material—their dreams—and the coach provides the tools: questions, reflections, and encouragement. Each session refines the vision, removing excess and adding depth. It's a creative partnership where the coach's expertise reveals the masterpiece within, turning abstract ideas into tangible realities.` },
                    { "name": "Neha Mayanka", "metaphor": "The Blank Canvas", "text": "A coach needs to free up their mind of their own biases and preconceived notions, to be able to hold the space, where a coachee is able to visualise their own thoughts, dreams and solutions.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `The blank canvas represents limitless potential, and the coach is the frame that holds it steady. Without imposing colors or shapes, the coach allows the coachee to paint freely. Through active listening and powerful questions, the coach helps the coachee choose brushes and hues, creating a masterpiece of self-discovery. This metaphor emphasizes the coach's role in providing space for creativity, ensuring the final artwork is authentically the coachee's own.` },
                    { "name": "Priya Sharma", "metaphor": "A Candle", "text": "My metaphor for coaching is a Candle. A coach is like a Candle, casting light on everything around us and offering us clear and better vision.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `In the darkness of uncertainty, a candle's flame guides the way, illuminating paths forward. The coach, like a candle, burns steadily, providing light without consuming the coachee. Each flicker represents insights gained, dispelling shadows of doubt. As the coachee progresses, the light grows brighter, symbolizing increased self-awareness and clarity. Ultimately, the coach's flame empowers the coachee to carry their own light into the future.` },
                    { "name": "Parul Sharma", "metaphor": "Gardening", "text": "A garden is a place where you can plant seeds, water them, and watch them grow. Coaching is similar to gardening. In coaching, you work with someone to help them grow and develop.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Gardening requires patience, care, and the right conditions for growth. The coach is the gardener, tending to the coachee's soil—mind and spirit—by planting seeds of ideas and watering them with encouragement. Weeding out obstacles and providing sunlight through positive reinforcement, the coach nurtures development. Over time, blooms of achievement emerge, demonstrating how coaching cultivates lasting personal and professional growth.` },
                    { "name": "Ramesh Balan", "metaphor": "A Sherpa", "text": "A coach could be viewed as a Sherpa, a skilled & experienced guide, a porter, and improviser, who empowers the mountaineer to summit?", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `In the treacherous terrain of personal challenges, the coach acts as a Sherpa, carrying burdens and offering wisdom. Sherpas know the paths, prepare supplies, and guide climbers to peaks. Similarly, coaches equip coachees with tools, share insights, and navigate obstacles. The summit represents goals achieved, and the journey builds resilience. Through partnership, the coachee gains strength, reaching heights once thought impossible.` },
                    { "name": "Ratnanjali Arora", "metaphor": "A Journey from Moth to Butterfly", "text": "Just like a moth undergoes metamorphosis to transform into a beautiful butterfly, coaching empowers individuals to shed their limitations, embrace growth, and emerge as strong, confident beings.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `The moth's cocoon is a phase of transformation, mirroring coaching's process of change. The coach facilitates the shedding of old habits, guiding the coachee through discomfort to emerge renewed. Wings of confidence develop through sessions, enabling flight towards aspirations. This metaphor highlights coaching's power in metamorphosis, turning potential into beauty and strength.` },
                    { "name": "Roopali Suri", "metaphor": "Crossing the bridge", "text": "Just like a bridge connects places, a coach connects a person’s self-awareness and desire for self-discovery on one side with self-responsibility and accountability on the other side.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Bridges span gaps, providing safe passage. The coach builds this bridge, connecting self-awareness to action. On one side, the coachee explores desires; on the other, they embrace responsibility. Through structured sessions, the coach ensures stability, helping the coachee cross confidently. The journey fosters accountability, leading to fulfilled goals and personal bridges built for future crossings.` },
                    { "name": "Reema Malhotra", "metaphor": "Alchemist", "text": "Alchemy and Coaching are a way of thinking, a Mindset and approaching situations with the intention of transformation and creating magic...", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Alchemy turns base metals into gold, symbolizing coaching's transformative magic. The coach, as alchemist, uses questions and insights to transmute challenges into opportunities. Through a mindset of possibility, coachees discover inner gold—strengths and potentials. This process requires patience and belief, resulting in profound changes that feel almost magical.` },
                    { "name": "Shashwati Srivastava", "metaphor": "Mirrors in a car", "text": "Coaching is like the various mirrors in a car: rear-view, side-view and blindspot mirrors that assist the driver in having a smooth drive to their destination.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Car mirrors provide perspectives for safe driving, much like coaching offers reflections for life's journey. The rear-view mirror shows past experiences, the side-view reveals current options, and the blind-spot mirror uncovers hidden obstacles. The coach helps the coachee adjust these mirrors, ensuring clear vision. Together, they navigate smoothly towards destinations, avoiding crashes and reaching goals efficiently.` },
                    { "name": "Soumen Dutta", "metaphor": "Eyeglasses", "text": "The foundation of all coaching conversations lies in a coach's genuine acceptance of their coachee's authentic self, fostering trust and connection.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Eyeglasses correct vision, allowing clear sight. The coach prescribes lenses of clarity through acceptance and trust. By fostering genuine connections, the coach helps coachees see truths obscured by biases. Sessions refine focus, enabling better decisions. Ultimately, coaching equips coachees with their own 'glasses' for ongoing self-awareness.` },
                    { "name": "Sujita Khemka", "metaphor": "The Thirsty Crow", "text": "This Metaphor of a 'Thirsty Crow' is akin to 'Coaching' per se... Whereby the Coachee is looking for a solution to a stated problem that is either not so clearly identified or needs a bit of probing and deep dive...", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `The thirsty crow drops pebbles to raise water, symbolizing problem-solving through persistence. The coach guides the coachee in 'dropping pebbles'—questions and reflections—to uncover solutions. What seems impossible becomes achievable with patience. This metaphor illustrates coaching's role in deep diving into issues, leading to innovative resolutions.` },
                    { "name": "Sanjeev Parkar", "metaphor": "A Metaphorical Ship Rudder", "text": "A coach serves as our trusted guide, providing us with direction, support, and motivation as we journey towards our goals.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `The ship's rudder steers through storms, representing the coach's directional guidance. While the coachee is the ship, the coach adjusts the rudder with support and motivation. Together, they navigate challenges, maintaining course towards goals. This partnership ensures steady progress, turning turbulent seas into successful voyages.` },
                    { "name": "Sashi Menon", "metaphor": "A railroad switch", "text": "a coach helps the coachee explore different train of thoughts before finally setting them on-course towards their dreams and aspirations.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Railroad switches redirect trains to new tracks. The coach acts as this switch, helping coachees explore thoughts and choose paths. Through exploration, coachees align with aspirations. The coach facilitates decisions, ensuring the journey leads to desired destinations with momentum and purpose.` },
                    { "name": "Uma Rao Ganduri", "metaphor": "The Coach as a Catalyst", "text": "Just as a catalyst speeds up the process of transformation without getting consumed, a coach accelerates an individual's growth journey, igniting potential and fostering change without overshadowing the coachee's unique identity.", "batch": "Batch-50", detailed: `Catalysts enable reactions without changing themselves. The coach catalyzes growth, sparking transformations through questions and support. Coachees evolve, retaining their identity while achieving potential. This metaphor emphasizes the coach's facilitative role, leading to sustainable, self-driven change.` },
                    
                    { "name": "Aditya Save", "metaphor": "Find Your Laila", "text": "Without a coach like Laila, Arjun would not have experienced this transformation... I hope you find your Laila.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `In the epic tale, Laila guides Arjun to self-realization. The coach embodies Laila, awakening potential through wisdom. Sessions reveal inner strengths, much like archery lessons. Coachees transform, finding purpose. This story inspires seeking guidance for personal epics of growth.` },
                    { "name": "Abdullah Taher", "metaphor": "Lighthouse", "text": "Lighthouse is my favorite metaphor for coaching as it resembles the role of a coach. A lighthouse assists in navigation by signaling safe entries to harbors but also by marking dangerous coastlines...", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Lighthouses guide ships through fog and storms. The coach is this beacon, illuminating paths and warning of hazards. Through consistent signals—insights and support—coachees navigate safely to harbors of success. This metaphor highlights coaching's role in providing clarity and safety in life's voyages.` },
                    { "name": "Bhushan Rajani", "metaphor": "SHADOW", "text": "To me, a coach is a shadow to a coachee who moves the conversation as a coachee wants just like a shadow moves along with body. It's about meeting your coachee where the coachee is.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Shadows follow without leading, adapting to movements. The coach mirrors the coachee, following their pace and direction. This presence fosters trust, allowing natural exploration. Sessions unfold organically, leading to authentic growth and self-discovery.` },
                    { "name": "Deepa Menon", "metaphor": "A Light", "text": "Coaching, like light, has the power to illuminate and guide individuals towards their goals and aspirations. Just as light dispels darkness, a good coach provides clarity, support, and motivation...", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Light pierces darkness, revealing truths. The coach shines light on coachees' paths, dispelling doubts with clarity and motivation. Through illumination, goals become visible, and support guides progress. This metaphor underscores coaching's transformative power in enlightening journeys.` },
                    { "name": "Janakiram Babu", "metaphor": "Caged Mind", "text": "Coaching helps you to come out of the CAGED MINDSET and to become self-aware which can lead to better decision making and personal growth.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `A caged mind traps potential. The coach unlocks the cage through awareness-building. Sessions free thoughts, enabling better decisions and growth. This liberation leads to expansive possibilities, turning confinement into freedom.` },
                    { "name": "Jahnavi Varampati", "metaphor": "A sculptor", "text": "Coaching, I realized, is not merely a profession or a practice. It's an art form. It's the art of being a sculptor of human potential.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Sculpting reveals beauty from stone. The coach carves potential into reality, using tools of dialogue. Coachees emerge shaped by their visions, with the coach's art facilitating creation. This process celebrates human artistry in transformation.` },
                    { "name": "K Narender Reddy", "metaphor": "Mother Nature", "text": "In the vast expanse of my professional journey as the CEO of a natural products company, I find myself drawn to a metaphor that beautifully encapsulates the essence of coaching - the rhythm of nature.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Nature's cycles—growth, decay, renewal—mirror coaching's rhythms. The coach nurtures like soil, providing conditions for flourishing. Coachees bloom through seasons of change, guided by natural wisdom. This metaphor emphasizes sustainable, organic development.` },
                    { "name": "Kedar Joshi", "metaphor": "Shing Moon Lake", "text": "I will always endeavor to bring the same calm stillness of the lake water surface to help my coachees get their ideas the farthest!", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Shing Moon Lake's calm surface reflects clarity. The coach creates this stillness, allowing ideas to travel far. Through peaceful sessions, coachees gain perspective, launching thoughts into action. This metaphor promotes serene, effective coaching.` },
                    { "name": "Manjunath PRABHAKAR", "metaphor": "Being a Compass", "text": "My metaphor for coaching is a Compass, a trusted instrument guiding through uncharted waters. It doesn't control the winds, but helps find our bearings, adjust our sails...", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `A compass orients without dictating. The coach guides coachees through uncertainties, helping adjust to winds of change. This tool fosters direction, leading to confident navigation and goal achievement.` },
                    { "name": "Niraj Mahajan", "metaphor": "The Catalyst", "text": "Metaphorically, a catalyst refers to someone that brings or accelerates change, growth, or development... a coach can be referred to as a catalyst.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Catalysts spark reactions. The coach catalyzes transformations, accelerating growth without altering core. Coachees evolve rapidly, achieving potentials through facilitated change.` },
                    { "name": "Neha Rai", "metaphor": "Life is A Journey!", "text": "As a coach, I can use the metaphor of a journey to help a coachee understand the process of achieving their goals. Just as a journey requires planning, preparation, and perseverance, so does achieving one's goals.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Journeys involve maps and milestones. The coach plans with coachees, preparing for perseverance. Together, they traverse paths to goals, building resilience and celebrating arrivals.` },
                    { "name": "Pradeep Warrier", "metaphor": "Sabarimala Temple", "text": "The discovery process that starts with the coachee committing to the journey. It takes significant effort & mental preparedness to come forward to come for such session.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Sabarimala's pilgrimage demands commitment. Coaching mirrors this, requiring mental preparation for transformative journeys. The coach guides through efforts, leading to spiritual and personal summits.` },
                    { "name": "Pallavi Poddar", "metaphor": "Unleashing Your Inner Butterfly", "text": "Just like a caterpillar... there was an untapped potential for transformation into something beautiful and extraordinary. This is where coaching stepped in, like a guiding light showing me the way...", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Caterpillars transform into butterflies. The coach guides metamorphosis, unleashing potential. Sessions nurture wings of change, leading to extraordinary flights of achievement.` },
                    { "name": "Shaifaly Sangal", "metaphor": "Walking Stick", "text": "For me coaching is like a walking stick. Both walking stick and coaching serve as aids that people often turn to when there's a specific need or requirement...", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Walking sticks provide support on rough paths. The coach offers aid for challenges, helping coachees walk steadily towards goals. This tool ensures stability and progress.` },
                    { "name": "Shwetha Kalappa", "metaphor": "Igniting the spark within", "text": "So, when I was asked to pick a metaphor for coaching, I was reminded of the cylindrical hollow iron bar. Every individual has a spark within waiting to be ignited.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Iron bars hold sparks. The coach ignites inner fires, fueling passions. Through sessions, coachees discover and amplify their sparks, driving transformative energy.` },
                    { "name": "Sandeep Jainapur", "metaphor": "Kung Fu Panda", "text": "My coach uses a variety of questioning techniques to encourage my self-reflection and exploration. Powerful questions prompt me to think deeply, challenge assumptions, and gain insights...", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `Po's journey in Kung Fu Panda inspires mastery. The coach trains coachees like masters, using questions for reflection. This leads to inner strength and achieved destinies.` },
                    { "name": "Siddharth Taneja", "metaphor": "Journey from hell to the light", "text": "The coachee is in trouble right now... or can fight their way back into the light. We as a coach can help them to help them with that fight 'One inch at a time'.", "batch": "Batch-51", detailed: `From darkness to light, inch by inch. The coach aids battles against troubles, guiding gradual progress. Sessions illuminate paths, fostering resilience and hope.` },
                    
                    { "name": "Anand Sen", "metaphor": "The Invisible Presence", "text": "A good metaphor for coaching would be that of becoming a malleable container which creates a space to allow flow to the coachee's entangled thoughts and finally emerge as a clear stream by the end of the conversation.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Invisible yet essential, like air. The coach provides space for thoughts to flow clearly. Sessions untangle complexities, emerging as streams of clarity.` },
                    { "name": "Divya Kumari", "metaphor": "Life is A Journey and so is Coaching!", "text": "Coaching is about picking up the tools and facilitating the coachee's thinking process to get them from present to desired state in an area they are exploring...", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Journeys require tools for progress. The coach equips coachees with mental tools, facilitating thinking towards desired states. This partnership ensures successful explorations.` },
                    { "name": "Deepanwita Dey", "metaphor": "Water", "text": "A coach is like water. Water...takes the shape of the container that it is poured to similarly with the coach they change their style and how they present themselves based on the ask of the coachee.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Water adapts to containers. The coach flexes styles to coachees' needs, fostering natural flow. Sessions shape around individuals, enabling adaptive growth.` },
                    { "name": "Deepa Chandrasekhar", "metaphor": "Teaching a Person to Fish", "text": "Coaching, like teaching a person to fish, empowers individuals to develop skills, knowledge, and self-belief that enable them to achieve their goals and navigate life's challenges effectively.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Teaching fishing builds self-sufficiency. The coach imparts skills for independent navigation. Coachees gain tools for lifelong challenges and achievements.` },
                    { "name": "Farrell Vaz", "metaphor": "Night Sky", "text": "I guess in an image, coaching is like two people lying on a grassy field looking up at the night sky and trying to unlock the secrets while marvelling at the beauty.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Stargazing unlocks wonders. The coach and coachee explore skies of potential, marveling at insights. Sessions reveal secrets of growth and beauty.` },
                    { "name": "Hemant Chimote", "metaphor": "A Wise Path Walker", "text": "The Coach, in this analogy, is a seasoned & wise path walker who has navigated the path of self-discovery... By sharing his insights, the coach becomes a beacon...", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Wise walkers guide others. The coach shares navigational wisdom, becoming a beacon for self-discovery. Coachees follow illuminated paths to enlightenment.` },
                    { "name": "Jayalakshmi NS", "metaphor": "'Baby led Weaning'", "text": "Coaching is akin to the Baby Led Weaning (BLW) approach... This method builds on the belief that babies have the innate ability to guide their own eating habits in a space of trust and safety.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `BLW trusts babies' abilities. The coach creates safe spaces for self-guided growth. Coachees explore autonomously, building trust and independence.` },
                    { "name": "Joydeep Dutta", "metaphor": "Catalysts", "text": "To me a coach is a catalyst, and the coaching process is catalysis. Just as presence of catalyst enhances the rate of chemical reaction of element(s), the presence of a coach in life of a coachee enhances the rate of a positive and progressive shift.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Catalysts accelerate reactions. The coach speeds positive shifts in coachees' lives. Presence enhances progress without consumption.` },
                    { "name": "Karan Bakshi", "metaphor": "The Polaris Star", "text": "The Polaris Star: Your Guiding Light to Personal Growth. Just as the Polaris Star remains steadfast in the night sky, guiding navigators towards true north, our core values and aspirations serve as our personal Polaris.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Polaris guides steadfastly. The coach aligns coachees with core values, navigating towards aspirations. This star ensures true directional growth.` },
                    { "name": "Meenakshi Talesra", "metaphor": "Orchestra Maestra", "text": "As I embark on my journey into coaching, I find myself drawn to the metaphor of an orchestra Maestra. This comparison beautifully encapsulates the essence of guiding individuals and teams towards their goals...", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Maestras harmonize orchestras. The coach conducts coachees' symphonies, guiding towards harmonious goals. Sessions create melodies of achievement.` },
                    { "name": "Nitin Kakkar", "metaphor": "Reflections", "text": "Coaching is achieving set goals through a dialogue between the coach and the coached... This is almost like seeing our reflection in the mirror to identify our physical appearance and working on ways to make it more attractive.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Mirrors reflect truths. The coach facilitates dialogues for self-reflection, improving 'appearances' of goals. Sessions enhance clarity and attractiveness of outcomes.` },
                    { "name": "Nidhi Kalpana", "metaphor": "Photography Lens", "text": "My passion for photography deeply influences my coaching metaphor... Just as a photographer captures the essence of a moment through the lens, I approach coaching with a keen eye for understanding individual strengths and unique challenges.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Lenses capture essences. The coach focuses on strengths, framing challenges. Sessions develop photos of growth and potential.` },
                    { "name": "Rajiv Bhargava", "metaphor": "Snorkelling", "text": "Snorkelling is much like coaching. It teaches us to embrace the unknown, breathe through new challenges, and, ultimately, uncover the richness of potential that lies beneath the surface.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Snorkeling explores depths. The coach guides coachees through unknowns, breathing through challenges. Sessions uncover rich potentials beneath surfaces.` },
                    { "name": "Recha Paliwal", "metaphor": "Explorer's Kit", "text": "For me, coaching is best represented by an 'Explorer's Kit.' Imagine an explorer setting out on a journey with this essential kit.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Explorer's kits equip adventures. The coach provides tools for journeys, aiding discoveries. Coachees explore with support, uncovering treasures.` },
                    { "name": "Paramjit Lamba", "metaphor": "Cooking", "text": "Cooking and coaching, at first glance, might seem very different. However, when we delve deeper, cooking serves as a powerful metaphor for coaching.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Cooking blends ingredients. The coach mixes insights for flavorful growth. Sessions create dishes of achievement from raw potentials.` },
                    { "name": "Shanti Uday", "metaphor": "Art of Blending Colors on Canvas", "text": "The metaphor of painting can be used to enhance and improve your coaching skills especially the technique of an artist blending colors on a canvas, where the artist is the Coach, the canvas is the Coachee and the colors used is the technique to bring about the desired results.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Blending colors creates art. The coach blends techniques on coachees' canvases. Sessions produce masterpieces of desired results.` },
                    { "name": "Saleena Khan", "metaphor": "Mirroring the Soul", "text": "The phrase 'Mirroring the Soul' alludes to the idea that coaching involves much more than just giving direction or counsel. It entails providing a metaphorical mirror to the coachee...", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Mirrors reflect souls. The coach provides deep reflections for self-understanding. Sessions reveal authentic selves beyond directions.` },
                    { "name": "Swapna Sangari", "metaphor": "Kaleidoscope", "text": "The kaleidoscope serves as a powerful metaphor for coaching. Just as a kaleidoscope transforms its view with every turn, coaching enables individuals to see their challenges and opportunities from new perspectives...", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Kaleidoscopes shift views. The coach turns perspectives on challenges. Sessions reveal new opportunities through transformations.` },
                    { "name": "Sushanth Ravikumar", "metaphor": "A Lighthouse", "text": "A coach is a lighthouse in the vast ocean of life. A coach serves as a beacon of guidance during times of uncertainty.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Lighthouses beacon guidance. The coach illuminates uncertainties in life's oceans. Sessions provide safe harbors through light.` },
                    { "name": "Sheetal Shekhar", "metaphor": "A Treasure Hunt", "text": "My metaphor encompassing all components of coaching...I found myself drawn to a more adventurous analogy a treasure hunt.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Treasure hunts seek riches. The coach guides coachees through clues of self-discovery. Sessions unearth treasures of potential.` },
                    { "name": "Shweta Mehra", "metaphor": "Climbing a Mountain", "text": "Climbing a mountain is a compelling metaphor for coaching. It encapsulates the essence of the journey, the challenges, and the triumphs involved in personal and professional development.", "batch": "Batch-54", detailed: `Mountain climbing conquers peaks. The coach supports ascents through challenges. Sessions lead to triumphant summits of development.` },
                    
                    { "name": "Anjali Byce", "metaphor": "The Mystic Masala", "text": "Being the foodie I am, the closest analogy that springs to my mind is that of a Masala (spice) Box! ...For a Chef (Coachee), the box (Coach) is the singular force that keeps all the melee of spices and flavours together.", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `Masala boxes organize flavors. The coach harmonizes coachees' elements. Sessions blend potentials into cohesive successes.` },
                    { "name": "Nidhi Gala", "metaphor": "Dance Concert", "text": "In my view this serves as a powerful metaphor for coaching. Just as a dancer would move to the rhythm of the music, individuals navigating their growth find their own beats guided by the support of the coach.", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `Dance concerts follow rhythms. The coach guides coachees' beats of growth. Sessions create performances of progress.` },
                    { "name": "Rajesh Natrajan", "metaphor": "Torchlight", "text": "Imagine walking in a deep dark jungle on a new moon night in the pitch darkened path with a torchlight. It doesn't' show you the entire journey all at once, but it gives you the courage to take the next steps safely.", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `Torchlights illuminate steps. The coach provides light for safe progress in darkness. Sessions build courage for journeys.` },
                    { "name": "Sonali Bhatnagar", "metaphor": "The CPS", "text": "Coaching is like a GPS where coaching can guide the coachee to reach their destination/goal, just like GPS can help someone to reach the terminus.", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `GPS guides destinations. The coach navigates coachees to goals. Sessions recalculate paths for success.` },
                    { "name": "Sharel Rivya", "metaphor": "The Tour Guide", "text": "As per my understanding on Coaching, I could relate the Tour Guide as a Coach for one's Journey. Just like how a tour guide leads a group through an unfamiliar city. The guide doesn't decide for the traveler...", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `Tour guides lead explorations. The coach facilitates coachees' journeys without dictating. Sessions enhance discoveries.` },
                    { "name": "Shazneen Gandevia", "metaphor": "Musical Notes", "text": "As coaches, we aren't the ones orchestrating the music for any client or even leading the dance; instead, we are like musical notes. The notes are essential elements that guide, uplift, and harmonize with our clients' journeys.", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `Musical notes harmonize. The coach uplifts coachees' melodies. Sessions create symphonies of growth.` },
                    { "name": "Umme Salma", "metaphor": "The Co-Pilot", "text": "Navigating corporate life is a lot like flying a plane. There will be storms... But with a good co-pilot, you're never alone in the cockpit.", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `Co-pilots share flights. The coach partners in life's storms. Sessions ensure safe navigations.` },
                    { "name": "Vaishali Sharma", "metaphor": "Time", "text": "The coachee's mind here represents the muddy water that needs time to settle, to let what is important surface, leaving behind doubts and excuses.", "batch": "Batch-55", detailed: `Time settles mud. The coach allows minds to clarify. Sessions surface truths over time.` },

                    { "name": "Ajay Kukreja", "metaphor": "A Photographer", "text": "It is important to understand the subject of the picture i.e. context of the Coachee and bring the photographer's curiosity to the craft to help figure out the source of light for them to be able to illuminate their path in their own words.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Photographers capture lights. The coach illuminates coachees' paths with curiosity. Sessions develop personal illuminations.` },
                    { "name": "Anupama Maakan", "metaphor": "An Earthen Pot", "text": "The coaching process is akin to the potter's wheel-a dynamic and evolving journey where growth unfolds continuously. The wheel symbolizes the structured coaching framework...", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Potter's wheels shape pots. The coach molds coachees' growth. Sessions create vessels of potential.` },
                    { "name": "Arijit Das", "metaphor": "A Candle", "text": "A coach is that humble candle who brings the light, the warmth and the trust in a person's life. While the candle burns in itself, it illuminates and shows the path.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Candles illuminate paths. The coach provides light and warmth. Sessions guide with trust.` },
                    { "name": "Akhil Mehrotra", "metaphor": "Clearing the Mist on the Mirror", "text": "A coach with the right set of questions clears the mist on the mirror for the coachee, who then can see the image very clearly.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Mirrors clear mists. The coach clarifies visions with questions. Sessions reveal clear images.` },
                    { "name": "Jonathan D'Souza", "metaphor": "A Mirror", "text": "A good coach, like a good mirror, doesn't change anything. They don't add filters, adjust the lighting, or make things look better... They simply hold up a clear reflection—so you can see yourself fully.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Mirrors reflect fully. The coach provides clear self-views. Sessions enable authentic seeing.` },
                    { "name": "Kinjal Dholakia", "metaphor": "The Lighthouse", "text": "Coaching is like a lighthouse serving as a navigational tool into one's core and soul.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Lighthouses navigate cores. The coach guides to souls. Sessions illuminate inner paths.` },
                    { "name": "Kunal Sarkar", "metaphor": "A Mountain Climb", "text": "The path to becoming a trained coach tower before me like a majestic peak disappearing into the clouds. As I begin this transformative journey, I'm reminded of the parallels between mountaineering and my pursuit of becoming a coach.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Mountain climbs ascend peaks. The coach supports transformative ascents. Sessions conquer heights.` },
                    { "name": "Kailash Nair", "metaphor": "Nimitta Matram Bhava Savyasachin", "text": "My visualization of this journey is self as an instrument ('Nimitta Matram Bhava Savyasachin') for my co-traveler, to co-create a space wherein they can get to their destination.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Instruments aid journeys. The coach co-creates spaces for destinations. Sessions facilitate arrivals.` },
                    { "name": "Manju Menon", "metaphor": "A Gardener", "text": "Coaching is like gardening, it's something that requires patience, care, and dedication. Both involve nurturing growth, removing obstacles, and creating an environment where development/growth can happen.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Gardeners nurture growth. The coach tends coachees' developments. Sessions cultivate potentials.` },
                    { "name": "Manali Nagory", "metaphor": "Motherhood", "text": "Motherhood, for me, is my metaphor for coaching—it's about growth, guidance, patience, and the magic of discovering yourself while helping someone else discover their path.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Motherhood guides growth. The coach nurtures discoveries. Sessions foster magical paths.` },
                    { "name": "Mahesh Jade", "metaphor": "Music", "text": "The most powerful moments in music aren't just the notes—it's the silence between them? Those pauses? That's where the magic happens. And coaching? It's the same.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Music's silences create magic. The coach pauses for insights. Sessions harmonize growth.` },
                    { "name": "Nidhi Bhardwaj", "metaphor": "A 'White Canvas'", "text": "To depict my role as your 'Coach', I have chosen a metaphor of being 'The White Canvas'. When you decide to paint your 'Mona Lisa', as a Coach, I am going to be 'The White Canvas' which would offer you all the possibilities of creating your 'Magnum Opus'.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `White canvases offer possibilities. The coach provides spaces for masterpieces. Sessions enable creations.` },
                    { "name": "Pranab Nellore", "metaphor": "The Tri-Fold Mirror", "text": "This trifold mirror is an apt metaphor for coaching... Coaching functions the same way as a tri-fold mirror, helping people see themselves and their situations from a broader point of view.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Tri-fold mirrors broaden views. The coach expands perspectives. Sessions reveal broader situations.` },
                    { "name": "Prabhanjan Kulkarni", "metaphor": "The Glass", "text": "A powerful metaphor which resonated strongly with me to understand the dynamic between a coach and a coachee is that of a glass... The coach is like the glass that holds liquid, and the liquid represents the emotions, thoughts, and challenges of the coachee.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Glasses hold liquids. The coach contains emotions. Sessions process challenges.` },
                    { "name": "Rajeshri Nakhwa", "metaphor": "Crafting a Diamond from a Stone", "text": "Coaching isn't about shaping others to fit an ideal—it's about selfless service, guiding them to uncover their own brilliance. And just like crafting a diamond, it requires patience, precision, and a deep commitment to the process...", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Crafting diamonds reveals brilliance. The coach guides uncoverings. Sessions polish potentials.` },
                    { "name": "Ritu Mendiratta", "metaphor": "The Answer Lies Within You", "text": "A COACH CREATES AN EXPERIENCE WHERE COACHEE CAN EXPLORE THEIR THOUGHTS & FEELINGS TO FIND THEIR OWN ANSWERS AND A PATH TO WALK!", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Answers lie within. The coach facilitates explorations. Sessions uncover paths.` },
                    { "name": "Rohini Phulpagar", "metaphor": "A Sculpture", "text": "The life coach is a sculpture which help the client to become a idol out of rock... The coach is knowing that idol is present there, just need little finishing.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Sculptures reveal idols. The coach finishes potentials. Sessions create idols.` },
                    { "name": "Rajasekar R", "metaphor": "The Celebration Called Life - The Water Cycle", "text": "The treasure has been within you all the time, waiting for you to find it. All I did was have a small conversation with you.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Water cycles celebrate life. The coach uncovers treasures. Sessions reveal inner riches.` },
                    { "name": "Sheena Kashyap", "metaphor": "Core Values as the Compass", "text": "Some see it as a bridge, some as a mirror, some as a CPS, while others call it an architect's pillar. Some compare it to a sculptor or a pottery maker, but I see it as Core Values—the true path-shaper.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Core values shape paths. The coach aligns with compasses. Sessions guide directions.` },
                    { "name": "Satchit Jamgaonkar", "metaphor": "Affirmations and Curiosity", "text": "I’ve found joy in crafting practical, purposeful affirmations. Allowing myself to look into the mirror and be ok with the image.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Affirmations and curiosity craft joys. The coach mirrors acceptances. Sessions foster self-oks.` },
                    { "name": "Shridhar Bhagwat", "metaphor": "The Coach, Philosopher & Friend", "text": "Coach for me is the 'Navigator' in any journey, one who travels with you not as a co-passenger but only to facilitate your preparations so that you successfully reach the selected destination you desired.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Navigators facilitate journeys. The coach prepares arrivals. Sessions ensure destinations.` },
                    { "name": "Sumita Rai", "metaphor": "A Journey through Authenticity and Patience", "text": "A coach is a torch bearer, navigating together to reach the level of awareness of the issue and creating an action plan.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Torch bearers navigate awareness. The coach creates plans. Sessions illuminate issues.` },
                    { "name": "Vamsi Koka", "metaphor": "The Key to the Magic World", "text": "A coach is the key to the magic world. A coach helps unlock this world by creating awareness and a strong urge to step into.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Keys unlock worlds. The coach creates awareness. Sessions urge steps.` },
                    { "name": "Varinder Kumar Verma", "metaphor": "The Celebration Called Life - The Water Cycle", "text": "COACH: OCEAN IS THE SOURCE, AND THE COACHEE IS THE RIVER, THE RIVER BEING COACHEE IS IN THE PROCESS AND JOURNEY OF BEING THE OCEAN.", "batch": "Batch-56", detailed: `Oceans source rivers. The coach journeys to oceans. Sessions flow processes.` },
                ];